      <link>https://www.aajkaal.in/sports/former-indian-cricketer-mohammed-kaif-opined-that-hardik-pandya-made-a-mistake-by-leaving-gujarat-titans-520294</link>
      <guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.aajkaal.in/sports/former-indian-cricketer-mohammed-kaif-opined-that-hardik-pandya-made-a-mistake-by-leaving-gujarat-titans-520294</guid>
